msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「이 당시에 ⟪k:3⟫저택은 어둠 속에 빠진 감옥이었습니다」"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E35BAA66_2050_4774_B272_0FCB6FDE5585
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
