"After a great deal of time on the run, the White-Haired Girl found herself at a remote mansion "
"that stood in a dark, overgrown forest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫백발 소녀가 ⟪k:38⟫도망 끝에 다다른 곳은―― 암녹빛이 우거진 어둠의 숲에 존재"
"하는 ⟪k:39⟫인적 없는 저택이었습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_AFEBC3C4_5AF7_4030_B83A_9E34957C8E95
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ae9bad01da0ded12db9f55c59a806be481e0377dece95a4a6846052a013358f
#. default-sha256: b640d99b0250136f6d2ca1de267f8b76677aaa3b3f74c8177c1c4b371f557f1f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AFEBC3C4_5AF7_4030_B83A_9E34957C8E95"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫All the windows were either boarded or shuttered, and it was even darker inside the house "
"than out. ⟪k:1⟫Not even a ray of moonlight could enter those walls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫모든 창문이 판자와 덧문으로 폐쇄되었기에, ⟪k:1⟫실내는 바깥보다 어두웠습니다. ⟪k:2⟫달빛조차 "
"⟪k:3⟫들어오지 못 하니까요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_ADB062E9_E426_4361_A74B_446D17D80C5C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7597cf6dd9c133f207fbf37560aaffe709634ef79c9f695f265a045ce1a5c170
#. default-sha256: 66d55194eb68283578da5d1b19088c018c1d5db89640bc8370493638247fae12
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_ADB062E9_E426_4361_A74B_446D17D80C5C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Only naturally, the White-Haired Girl⟪k:1⟫had assumed that nobody lived there,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫백발 소녀는 당연히 ⟪k:1⟫그런 저택에 ⟪k:2⟫사람이 살 거라 보진 않았으나――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_BB7025AD_075F_449F_AF2C_A1E7C0EAB154
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17b67a6050dce1af6613867566f033b2867df520c22786494597972512787d6f
#. default-sha256: d6f1f8f3f73b650d96dc1ab08c200b3ef1c0cfefbec797a37f307867e863d3d6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BB7025AD_075F_449F_AF2C_A1E7C0EAB154"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but her guess was incorrect.⟪k:1⟫Someone did, indeed, dwell in the house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫예상과 달리 ⟪k:1⟫살던 사람이 있었지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_063519C7_29A5_48FC_982F_67086C2728C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a77478aa4e01fd5c88c5b8c58c2423ce8714ab0e3dd4a8915674c28e9f44ca3
#. default-sha256: c894d4160fdc4d780ef6b25652d4d51baab94de5bf19ee447c56539c213cf318
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_063519C7_29A5_48FC_982F_67086C2728C1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a young man named Michel. ⟪k:1⟫Though she could not make out the details of his face "
"in the candlelight, she thought him a very handsome man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 청년의 이름은 미셸이었습니다. ⟪k:1⟫촛불에 비추어진 미셸의 얼굴은 ⟪k:2⟫뚜렷하게 보이진 않을"
"지언정―― 매우 아름다워 보였습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6D06033B_76FB_4AD6_B6E2_689D1E6CB834
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a56e7d5642ce1ca9aabd7eba92ed148e07309a132947537c6796e03a0aa768d5
#. default-sha256: 10baccd72932110830ebbd2812d9313505615c9deb726d70a109b8b4d3b867c6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6D06033B_76FB_4AD6_B6E2_689D1E6CB834"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, he proclaimed to her that a witch resided within the mansion, and that he too was "
"cursed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 미셸은 저택에 마녀가 있다고 하며, ⟪k:1⟫본인이 저주받은 몸이란 말을 꺼냈습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F97B061F_C94C_4E47_9083_4DF3A43CF7F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1618c868c6408afd89627242807fb05cb894d84bc3efaa5844debb82ce9eaee
#. default-sha256: cf4dd96c8ab6e7be49f6d68347c15c563a89b67ad2171eebe4ae2c1d25f47bb7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F97B061F_C94C_4E47_9083_4DF3A43CF7F4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everyone who got close to him lost their lives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫미셸에게 가까이 간 자는 ⟪k:1⟫모두 ⟪k:2⟫목숨을 잃는다 했지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D46E1850_A638_4423_8478_E8299693BAC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 995449e5a4eb34beca8a86da9a6f52004f189cb931d01dba5e324b5b2e1e8b89
#. default-sha256: 654fb320f25caddb4aea261b8963d3a094027256468f79ddfaef40b6b6bd6185
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D46E1850_A638_4423_8478_E8299693BAC6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Do you think that what he told her was all nonsense?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A lie devised to chase her out "
"of the house?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫황당무계하게 들리시는지요? ⟪k:1⟫백발 소녀를 쫓아내기 위한 허언 같으신지요?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_887E6F9E_D819_4002_A13F_1F6FE4BFC4CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b0acea7a528734dac07af74b4036a892be18b349ce02ce9e9de766d58d6a7d0
#. default-sha256: 454982df5d32bdbc27622aa3eb0453962814efcb21806b9d0691deb25b640041
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_887E6F9E_D819_4002_A13F_1F6FE4BFC4CE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The truth of the matter shall come to light in time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 진실은 머지않아 드러날 겁니다……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_DAE10AA8_CF55_4E6B_8531_40A384D97174
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7913873dc9ca720a4184bce9b1a7418cf14412b1d3e217851504009bf76a7d7
#. default-sha256: ba2268afa31563f60656bfd79d9c25a1d5dfa7adcf2b744daedccd8b27c205c4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DAE10AA8_CF55_4E6B_8531_40A384D97174"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Despite Michel’s assertions, the White-Haired Girl decided she would take up "
"residence within the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫백발 소녀는 미셸이 저주받았단 말을 듣고도 ⟪k:3⟫저택에 남기로 했습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_667912EF_7C4A_4A04_A635_6ED2F38EABC0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d02afef94b57d53e7ed69737b187a25865611a4a277d933553b0ce31a488a4db
#. default-sha256: 62daf5677b1662098187b5cff86498787af2f24b63e02d8f7a34c51e39bc16a2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_667912EF_7C4A_4A04_A635_6ED2F38EABC0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This era’s White-Haired Girl was younger than the others; ⟪k:1⟫she was still in her early "
"teens, young enough to be seen as still a child."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이 시대의 소녀는 ⟪k:1⟫다른 세 시대의 소녀들보다 젊어서―― 아직 10대 전반이었습니다. ⟪k:2⟫얼핏 "
"보면 ⟪k:3⟫아이로도 보였지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D2425DFE_6D2B_4CFA_945A_6627E9588E3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1afafdfd4a0c1acab1d64b72da97e9234c3a1691ed6a8b15b689e733236e19a6
#. default-sha256: 43beba4b733e2e0e905d6450fa8d494b73f74c8208735d8020e5c6372d4eaec9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D2425DFE_6D2B_4CFA_945A_6627E9588E3D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But she was neither as self-centered nor irresponsible as you might expect of someone her "
"age. ⟪k:1⟫She was very delicate and reserved, and acted with a great deal of modesty and "
"restraint."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 그 또래답게 이기적이거나 방종맞지 않고, ⟪k:1⟫신중함, ⟪k:2⟫차분함, ⟪k:3⟫조신함, ⟪k:4⟫사"
"려심을 고루 갖춘 아이였습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_5F668DAB_F665_40A3_8C34_2A2FB0ACC034
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31cb3991bdb4186375e7247d20c1af3398a844c3faac1c61e70ef9e11a64da51
#. default-sha256: 6ca3b8819a3bd06de7df8a00fb693e1b0568792e1d75a5158e2123d2bae8a39c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5F668DAB_F665_40A3_8C34_2A2FB0ACC034"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The accusations of her being a criminal and a sinner were grossly inappropriate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런 소녀에게 죄인이란 말을 쓰기에는 ⟪k:1⟫몹시 부적절했지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3E99F111_B2C5_4066_BB9C_80997DD2F721
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24126fb47a01fcd9ae0fd147098d12863f101e7f0f0939e620e6059e9d72671a
#. default-sha256: 5edb25750e866bf92ffaf7dcc668dc037c549c2dbba434b99542b394e23557e5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3E99F111_B2C5_4066_BB9C_80997DD2F721"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nevertheless, she was still chased from her home, barely managing to flee to this mansion "
"with her life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그러나 소녀가 ⟪k:1⟫사람들에게 쫓기다 ⟪k:2⟫갈 곳을 잃고, ⟪k:3⟫목숨만 부지한 채 저택까지 온 건 "
"사실입니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_850175EC_D1E2_45B3_9009_E5E6C4FD45CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9995f6c1a52830ff6f25198851aa69715dbfd600cceaeb0c9bb57bc004d0165c
#. default-sha256: e50fec81f04f59ffc51c5c90c5abf7870d91cbf52edc3a95a8f5ba8acc676f40
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_850175EC_D1E2_45B3_9009_E5E6C4FD45CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, the White-Haired Girl thought it would be rude to simply take up space in the mansion, "
"so she chased down the master, Michel,⟪k:1⟫and asked,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫자, ⟪k:1⟫그 백발 소녀는―― ⟪k:2⟫저택에 그냥 눌러앉긴 미안했는지, ⟪k:3⟫저택의 주인인 미셸에게 "
"⟪k:4⟫이런 말을 했습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_564B2023_C5DB_4394_B3B1_ABF82315653B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc0768f0c1a34729595d3452c88433b2fcdc2fd763986ae003e18cc568316775
#. default-sha256: c3cae877b128c1ca2831bec64d827254d2bd5ff032b5c55cbfb3f5fa649e79ea
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_564B2023_C5DB_4394_B3B1_ABF82315653B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Um... ⟪k:1⟫is there anything I can do to help?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I will clean or cook or do anything—"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫just let me know."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저기……, ⟪k:1⟫제가 뭐라도 ⟪k:2⟫가능한 건 없을까요? ⟪k:3⟫청소든 ⟪k:4⟫요리든 ⟪k:5⟫뭐든 말씀만 "
"해 주시면……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_80723D57_F9F3_4459_871F_E1D44427A5FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd7b08140e4817d83ec5d39d1e9b507928e01138ba40bff77cc293ee06c8fdc3
#. default-sha256: e92e89fc8abbb93b74f333accd7bf72fb3016c97225ae006876a944f6a3e9411
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_80723D57_F9F3_4459_871F_E1D44427A5FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………."

#: scenario4:scenario4_BE10CFE3_211A_4E34_88DD_5AB38D5D4A1B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a7f7918300ef398fae3021e2d351f378c4ec3049c16708b30022578eeed7a2d
#. default-sha256: 908b8405974dc5e28a54ae08282ac2441bb579e6735f7b799c5b1fce3276fc4d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BE10CFE3_211A_4E34_88DD_5AB38D5D4A1B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I want to repay you for allowing me to stay here..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫여기 있게 해 주시니, ⟪k:4⟫보은이라도 해야……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_5D5AB78C_0984_436E_A62A_E3D175B98131
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19b2a01e6a0bde6dcfee2c85dad7a79f8923a26bbe2fe2549773dab1c0faca1a
