msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5D5AB78C_0984_436E_A62A_E3D175B98131"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You need not feel indebted to me.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The weight of that obligation will only turn "
"into disdain."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……은혜를 느낄 필요는 없습니다. ⟪k:2⟫그것도 머지않아 ⟪k:3⟫원한으로 바뀔 테니까요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_5989BD40_9C21_4DF3_BC15_C6D54F5A1546
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd771cee7bed8c6d22c666cface3f8daf8260a62219511100068f8d5828e3972
#. default-sha256: 785e0ffaa0080b786c78175a54c74c646d1893493e8f9ff87c4bc386896bd85f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5989BD40_9C21_4DF3_BC15_C6D54F5A1546"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫B-⟪k:3⟫But... ⟪k:4⟫I can’t just stay here and do nothing..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……그, ⟪k:3⟫그래도, ⟪k:4⟫아무것도 안 하고 ⟪k:5⟫지내긴……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_50086CCC_ABE3_4BC5_BF22_BCA61B0D64F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9cae78893bd25db3a562701b009afce90c4d6d48173999c3e5aebe0cc14dc6b
