msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C59BA84F_5331_4567_A82E_6BA83629ACDD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2692ccff1ebc108abdb4b7bc2c4f2daf6cc4432a55b8d55f4f353aed997e805f
#. default-sha256: 8a3850f6405fab9196e676389ac9ac258620884f5b26d157f7be0242e2d083a5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C59BA84F_5331_4567_A82E_6BA83629ACDD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He said emotionlessly, turning away and walking off."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫미셸은 감정 없는 목소리로 말하곤, ⟪k:3⟫소녀에게서 시선을 돌려―― 그대로 떠났습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C5865549_F44E_4E64_96BF_CA4EC9008A78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58cc5a87aa7f6c2f5f65aa432ed62f2d6f724c550c780762341bb42f8744ab08
#. default-sha256: 86b2e35b0a4039a65f46034a6204c20be1061a0fe29b8712b6658fe1fffdadaa
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C5865549_F44E_4E64_96BF_CA4EC9008A78"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel was not, I believe, spurning her—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫he was merely disinterested. ⟪k:3⟫He did "
"not treat her disrespectfully, nor did he seem averse to her presence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그건 ⟪k:1⟫거절 이전에 무관심에 가까워 보였습니다. ⟪k:2⟫험하게 대하지도, ⟪k:3⟫꺼리지도 않으"
"나……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_EC91C502_9764_4B00_9534_C62C88A276DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4137251f8f4b5bf67d2462460a3fcc5eabd6c6ccaa8b680cce87e5711ab38af
#. default-sha256: 35d71b09e481d693b3235549ed82c1f08b1dc82611e9a6bd8edc7d7230c47712
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EC91C502_9764_4B00_9534_C62C88A276DF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Words simply did not seem to affect him at all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫무슨 말을 해도 ⟪k:1⟫마음까지 닿지 않는 것 같았습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_54050BD7_BD20_4F3F_89D2_ACF387428879
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70c6b3e2c0655b98b203f91c5053587356d32fe0ff4312f5b237d32ac7efdbb6
#. default-sha256: c74ec8e55b074fb048b5088eb615e2221d7e5c6c588b33dc0735e22b6ccb3b2e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54050BD7_BD20_4F3F_89D2_ACF387428879"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not only was the mansion a prison for his body, his body was also a prison ensnaring his "
"heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저택이 감옥이라면 ⟪k:1⟫미셸의 육체 또한 감옥이던 걸 수도 있겠군요. ⟪k:2⟫내면에 남은 ⟪k:3⟫마음"
"⟪k:4⟫이란 것을 가두기 위한 감옥."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7D6004BB_B5C1_46B7_A5CE_1F03430A4971
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3cea3d259220875c5bcd3b958d56949a40860338d68ce7e52d26e26abdfeb3df
#. default-sha256: 05330d2c52c4c6a39e8ef4ab1368891b7bd4cfefff3f3a7a72f37e2c2e7547f3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7D6004BB_B5C1_46B7_A5CE_1F03430A4971"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I should still do whatever I can.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(그래도…… 가능한 건 ⟪k:1⟫해야지)"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C646BDA3_4462_4C88_B7FF_B8279C83B0D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 101031131813f0cf2fdb9f18f53b4931c9db25ece96769a221ca779b64ca4d05
#. default-sha256: e03cc5a7f49b40c1442a517533afa52bedacde205585804fc46a5e7fef367739
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C646BDA3_4462_4C88_B7FF_B8279C83B0D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But she did not let that get her down. ⟪k:1⟫In fact, she might have even interpreted his "
"disinterest as kindness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫소녀는 꿋꿋했습니다. ⟪k:2⟫아니지요, ⟪k:3⟫소녀는 오히려 ⟪k:4⟫미셸의 무관심조차 호"
"의적으로 느낀 걸 수도 있겠습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_13131F31_9A42_41A0_9E64_6EA53DC69456
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b632bbcc2dc4daf81a72f13b439fb64dc45866e72855c218bd72fe99dbffd91
#. default-sha256: 21e7a4bfe17dc84d67aeebe2ffd10837b6d102e47eb869d5a5839f706a084f86
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_13131F31_9A42_41A0_9E64_6EA53DC69456"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though he was a bit standoffish, he did not attempt to cause her harm. ⟪k:1⟫He was nothing "
"like the people who had accused her of being a witch and forced her to flee for her life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫미셸은 냉담하지만 ⟪k:1⟫소녀에게 해를 끼치려 하진 않았습니다. ⟪k:2⟫소녀를 비방하며 쫓아다니던 "
"자들하곤 명백히 달랐지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_40245605_7D13_496B_AAB5_8DF61CBD11F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45b91d640619dcc6cb72ae2772ef2230d6b254258803d297012e69fb67732320
#. default-sha256: 24fc57c2216ef99d9fe7532c4f49e4a343912f2276d9600d43245dae5e02ffb2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_40245605_7D13_496B_AAB5_8DF61CBD11F2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And she was deeply grateful for that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소녀 안에선 ⟪k:1⟫그게 ⟪k:2⟫마냥 고마웠을 겁니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3C7A6950_6D50_412E_B0FA_7756486CE3C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27556851a7badd758249bae6dd89f523029dfdb6bc1614e9d361cb103e83eae5
#. default-sha256: b33926f2ba62c16f204222e39dbbe9f7047d58f661f0758bdbbdb623c24e0149
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3C7A6950_6D50_412E_B0FA_7756486CE3C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Thus began their quiet life together—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Michel, who avoided contact with others, "
"and the White-Haired Girl, who had taken a great deal of abuse from others."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫사람과 접촉하길 거부하는 미셸과 ⟪k:2⟫사람들에게 핍박당하던 백발 소녀."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6D41E979_C176_416B_9A55_48944A13EFCE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c29d9a74b4abbdf76d8ef1675c7af9bde134326c8e9e0d2a5cdd1b97630e3ea5
#. default-sha256: 340d517576b59a2996cff7caa8326782ea3b1b7ed3c671f335eb8a34ede2fd86
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6D41E979_C176_416B_9A55_48944A13EFCE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Two people who knew hardly anything about one another—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫who were too distant to "
"really be said to be living “together.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫둘의 생활은 ⟪k:1⟫조용히 ⟪k:2⟫막을 열었습니다. ⟪k:3⟫서로를 완전히 모르는 채로, ⟪k:4⟫동거라 하"
"기엔 동떨어진 존재인 채로."

#: scenario4:scenario4_AB6ABACB_5661_491D_B2AC_B361299E2335
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 525189bbc23783c1ef74ed2077f840a5a918836e29c01cffce628b8dc2fcf108
#. default-sha256: 46d4726bb3a18a49476c2866a516d0faf63d40c4200e82cad77e62fc06a75090
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AB6ABACB_5661_491D_B2AC_B361299E2335"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel spent most of his day in his chambers, so they only ever saw each other occasionally, "
"and they hardly ever spoke."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫미셸은 하루 대부분을 본인의 방에서 지냈으며, ⟪k:1⟫가끔 마주쳐도 마땅한 대화를 나누려 하지도 "
"않았습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_57099ACB_C553_4EC9_955F_FAA781ED6BC2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87d8fd347bd195f492fb69ea463af4f408f6ceac434b7946d391753faa7bf62f
#. default-sha256: bf955632965aeb1d28affbc52f7d08964195ef3bd09c24c0ae05a16ca42a932e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_57099ACB_C553_4EC9_955F_FAA781ED6BC2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though they stayed in the same house,⟪k:1⟫they both still lived solitary lives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫같은 장소에 살아도 ⟪k:1⟫각자 고독하게 사는 것이나 다름없었지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_2279AA0A_4CF2_4489_AA22_A8D2847C68CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8bb19ca4c93b6aac054fc8d09d3823eed7b91650037a2b002eb1d02af438eaa1
#. default-sha256: e589b7444f16262257500decde6a3ef1ac5ef9c09747ce82c0aaf9a8484da746
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2279AA0A_4CF2_4489_AA22_A8D2847C68CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, the White-Haired Girl wanted to get to know Michel better."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래도 ⟪k:1⟫백발 소녀는 ⟪k:2⟫미셸을 조금이나마 더 알고 싶어 했습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6F15CC23_D3F5_4FEC_993D_333844D58D28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29c45029b981999a0273661e26d2f6e8c5e46386514efc55496c381bdc65a129
#. default-sha256: 0a2b1002436018a357378bb5b57b0ca83c44b070258411aabe984b253e86ebfd
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6F15CC23_D3F5_4FEC_993D_333844D58D28"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She wanted to know why he called himself cursed,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫미셸이 왜 본인을 저주받았다고 하는지."

#: scenario4:scenario4_BE41FC56_496B_4165_A681_048D619EEEF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 279528e85be7b78e9f0f0e53a52d1f43dd2ce89b1aa5c4e709d4828eb1de35b4
#. default-sha256: ae656ce1164d64ffcbb4ccdd3ab31509419f51917e0ff0d8208aec9cdc87dd1d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BE41FC56_496B_4165_A681_048D619EEEF0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫why... ⟪k:1⟫he lived alone in this dark mansion,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고 왜……⟪k:1⟫이토록 캄캄한 저택에서 ⟪k:2⟫홀로 사는지."

#: scenario4:scenario4_56924B05_D029_4EF7_86C2_FBCF3E8ECDB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e20adb2cfa26572f3b2ce1796e98676ab7bf64046136e721077e7c3ccfc9b7e
#. default-sha256: a42f88cb821ffbaeb2ffdfb351d56b3996a92102806f28a1d6a8e11fb8b3ee25
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_56924B05_D029_4EF7_86C2_FBCF3E8ECDB0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫how many days, how many years he had spent here in solitude."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫며칠, ⟪k:1⟫몇 년 동안 ⟪k:2⟫저택 안에서 홀로 지냈는지."

#: scenario4:scenario4_02943C5C_88AC_4B7C_9445_C1E7DDA92F8E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6224e914e5c6b73e7ea74c83d2b80c7538e8314a6c5ac879b7f6b28af1151f7c
#. default-sha256: 5b0baacf6cc205825d2a806103114e771ca5f1e1fb9b47a8c6784d8149ad7d60
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_02943C5C_88AC_4B7C_9445_C1E7DDA92F8E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And while she waited for the opportunity, she also started doing things around the house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소녀는 그 기회를 기다리면서도 ⟪k:1⟫본인이 가능한 걸 ⟪k:2⟫시작하려 했습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FEAE5476_5E22_4BE2_B5CE_EBB1071EF666
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54d7b75117407585f4d45499b31a220f5a876cd7e4c8910ac58aee3240953b45
#. default-sha256: 34572056840fb26f100e2256fbbf1cd0cec505a670f7d1f2b1d35ad0471f7284
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FEAE5476_5E22_4BE2_B5CE_EBB1071EF666"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The first project she set out to take care of was cleaning. ⟪k:2⟫As the windows were "
"all firmly shut, her only source of light was candles."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫소녀는 맨 먼저 ⟪k:2⟫청소부터 시작했습니다. ⟪k:3⟫창문은 열릴 가망도 안 보이니 ⟪k:4⟫광원이"
"라곤 촛불 뿐."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E96CF4DB_B15B_4BF1_ADC2_C15D8B247304
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8ca091c9aeb854806de7257ebc57fc89600aa70d9ddb2904181f53f9cb391eb
#. default-sha256: 809b68e241ee9381f49e964469a1397ab8343fb94ff7ca093bc89c397615617e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E96CF4DB_B15B_4BF1_ADC2_C15D8B247304"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For whatever reason, there was a great deal of candles stored in the cellar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아무래도 ⟪k:1⟫창고에는 양초가 많이 있는 모양이었습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B3569F31_3996_4693_8CB4_72193079A5B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea6c4f05401e333295a8f7fb0252abd1bfd36dcf1645ab7fabdbc77d4b646c0d
#. default-sha256: 8e199d9179f2309fd992697148f3a1af2fb9b2e2fcf17bf903b0ad2ad0dfdad2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B3569F31_3996_4693_8CB4_72193079A5B7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She wondered where on earth he had acquired so many, but she never found the opportunity to "
"ask him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫도대체 어디서 공급되는 건지 의문이 들었지만, ⟪k:1⟫이를 질문할 기회는 좀처럼 찾아오질 않았습니"
"다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_790671EB_16E3_4500_8067_C875CA673253
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a56a2f358ed256a6dcbabb398ec7d1f6e274b79953de07f0e2dacb73a3e3b33
#. default-sha256: 9461718c230e75ce9b4fa7b3ba512f94a2907b816fab77abc93a4e1dd5c34868
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_790671EB_16E3_4500_8067_C875CA673253"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was difficult to even see all the dust and cobwebs with only candlelight, and considering "
"the poor airflow through the house, she was afraid her efforts were going to be in vain."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫촛불만으로는 먼지가 얼마나 쌓였는지 제대로 안 보이는 데다, ⟪k:1⟫공기 순환도 잘 안 되는 저택 "
"안에선 ⟪k:2⟫별 의미가 없을 수야 있겠으나――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_73075EBA_6725_4B69_BE7A_FC90071FF6BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b92e9dd446a9e2f8b986e41512f9478c69fe685c3db3a77b74461a76c1286a2d
#. default-sha256: d3ac0337293ce4e0e58b1438615bcbc23cc0fdba72bb430f790bef42b8adcc0a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_73075EBA_6725_4B69_BE7A_FC90071FF6BE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Still she persisted, sweeping and wiping things down, one room at a time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래도 소녀는 ⟪k:1⟫부지런하게 ⟪k:2⟫청소를 했습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A9B09618_AA36_4C3F_8C7A_ECABE6D861FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ddf8756702ed1931f45ad35e13f3eeda6b69a4a85ea00f5126ba2fe37665796
