msgid "⟪k:0⟫They’re... ⟪k:1⟫books.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Incredible... ⟪k:4⟫Real books."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이거…… ⟪k:1⟫책이네. ⟪k:2⟫놀랍다……, ⟪k:3⟫실물이구나."

#: scenario4:scenario4_38886115_8108_4B46_86B1_0AA90E57CCA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
